[{ "action": "append", "id": "event-modals", "value" : "<div tabindex=\"-1\" id=\"modal-6a5ad965-e808-4d7f-a978-c069ed49b7f4\" class=\"modal\"><div class=\"modal-dialog modal-lg\"><div class=\"modal-content\"><div class=\"modal-header\"><a data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"close\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span></a><p class=\"text-muted\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-road\"></span> Research Track</p><strong>Wed 15 Apr 2026 16:15 - 16:30 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/icse-2026/icse-2026-venue-oceania-vii\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Oceania VII</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track#program\" class=\"navigate\">Software Engineering for AI 3</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/valentinalenarduzzi\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Valentina Lenarduzzi</a></small></div><div class=\"modal-body\"><div class=\"bg-primary event-title\"><h4><span data-event-star=\"6a5ad965-e808-4d7f-a978-c069ed49b7f4\" title=\"Add event to your program\"><span class=\"text-disabled glyphicon glyphicon-star-empty\"></span></span><strong>Comfrey: Mitigating Integration Failures in LLM-enabled Software at Run-Time</strong></h4></div><div class=\"bg-info event-description\"><p>Due to the unrestricted outputs of LLMs and strict requirements of software components, integration failures are widespread in software that incorporates LLM agents and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG). Even seemingly correct LLM/RAG responses can trigger software misbehaviors if they violate these requirements.</p>\n<p>In this paper, we conduct an empirical study to understand integration failures in real-world LLM-enabled applications. Guided by this study, we present Comfrey, a runtime framework that adapts the LLM agent and RAG responses to meet software requirements, serving as a middle layer between AI and software components. It automatically detects and resolves potential integration failures through a three-stage workflow, ensuring component compatibility. Our evaluation with a variety of open-source applications demonstrates that Comfrey detects 75.1% and prevents 63.3% of potential integration failures with 8.4% overhead, significantly outperforming the baselines. The artifact is available on Anonymous GitHub.</p>\n<p></p><p></p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/yuchenshao\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Yuchen Shao\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/yuchenshao/78d4e89c-226e-4158-b997-ccd618deeb59/micro-avatar?1783975763000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Yuchen Shao<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">East China Normal University, Shanghai Innovation Institute</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/yuhenghuang1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Yuheng Huang\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/yuhenghuang1/b6b6073a-e8b8-4799-b584-a6882683f05d/micro-avatar?1783975892000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Yuheng Huang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">The University of Tokyo</span></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/jiazhenzou\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Jiazhen Zou<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">East China Normal University</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/yulingshi\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Yuling Shi\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/yulingshi/88bbc0c4-23fd-4d72-b87f-6fec0346e469/micro-avatar?1783979637000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Yuling Shi<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Shanghai Jiao Tong University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/longyang1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Long Yang<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">East China Normal University</span></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/leima\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Lei Ma\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/leima/96d36f67-42d7-4691-beb2-753e4f69a9b2/micro-avatar?1783972608000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Lei Ma<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">The University of Tokyo &amp; University of Alberta</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>Japan</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/tingsu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Ting Su\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/tingsu/eae049bb-1dc5-48c3-9e85-282b5238423a/micro-avatar?1791788014000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Ting Su<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">East China Normal University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/icse-2026/chengchengwan\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"Chengcheng Wan\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getProfileImage/chengchengwan/1c3d7b84-12ce-4887-abd7-9d7cda86d42f/micro-avatar?1789522955000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Chengcheng Wan<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">East China Normal University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/319/Comfrey-Mitigating-Integration-Failures-in-LLM-enabled-Software-at-Run-Time\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default nav